  "solution": {
    "text": "For an adiabatic process,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Pv</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>constant</mtext></math><br /><br />Differentiating with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dP</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dv</mtext></mfrac><mfenced><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mi>&#947;</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dP</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;P</mi></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext></mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dv</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;P</mi></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext></mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Adx</mtext></math><br /><br /><u><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"197\" src=\"assets\\st0145_0381e5ec5788.jpg\" width=\"188\" /></strong></u><br /><br />Thus, the&nbsp;acceleration,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dF</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">M</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">PA</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">MV</mtext></mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dx</mtext></math><br /><br />Comparing with ,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dx</mtext></math>, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>f</mi></math><br /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>"
  }
